# Nx loads this file for every `lint` task: clippy fails on warnings, as the local check's
# `--config 'build.warnings="deny"'` does. nx-rust passes `--message-format=json`, under which
# cargo ignores `build.warnings`, so the flag goes to rustc. Cargo prefers this variable to
# `RUSTFLAGS`, which Nx would not override.
CARGO_ENCODED_RUSTFLAGS=-Dwarnings
